WEBVTT

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:30.170
That widow told on me?

00:01:30.440 --> 00:01:32.000
Watch your words!

00:01:32.280 --> 00:01:35.850
Ms. Otonashi told me because
she was concerned about you.

00:01:36.860 --> 00:01:39.410
Unforgivable!
I will never forgive her!

00:01:39.950 --> 00:01:41.780
How dare she tell on me!

00:01:42.390 --> 00:01:44.220
If that's the way she's
going to play...

00:01:46.830 --> 00:01:48.800
It's all out war!

00:02:34.040 --> 00:02:36.600
They can't complain
if my test score improves.

00:02:37.010 --> 00:02:39.100
That widow's "concerned"?

00:02:39.480 --> 00:02:40.600
All she wants to do

00:02:40.910 --> 00:02:44.410
is to take Mr. Godai
away from me.

00:02:44.820 --> 00:02:46.220
Well, I'm not losing to her!

00:02:58.000 --> 00:02:59.720
Manager, see you!

00:03:00.180 --> 00:03:01.220
Bye!

00:03:06.180 --> 00:03:09.340
I wonder why he's so peppy?

00:03:11.910 --> 00:03:15.100
Maybe 'cause that girl
hasn't been here lately.

00:03:15.560 --> 00:03:18.620
Come to think of it, she
didn't come at all last week.

00:03:29.230 --> 00:03:31.560
I'm going to hand out
the comparative scores

00:03:31.630 --> 00:03:33.690
from the mock test
you took the other day.

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:37.960
Aoki... Akazawa... Akiyama...

00:03:38.100 --> 00:03:39.370
Sato...

00:03:40.350 --> 00:03:41.530
Shimamoto...

00:03:41.910 --> 00:03:44.380
And Shimizu...

00:03:44.480 --> 00:03:45.380
How did you do?

00:03:45.510 --> 00:03:46.500
Bad.

00:03:46.980 --> 00:03:49.350
Look how much
I've improved!

00:03:49.480 --> 00:03:50.850
I envy you.

00:03:51.220 --> 00:03:54.510
If my parents see my score,
no dinner for me tonight.

00:03:54.790 --> 00:04:00.380
Mita... Minakami...
Minagawa... Yagami...

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:02.190
Yagami?

00:04:03.730 --> 00:04:05.970
Next is Chiba...

00:04:07.310 --> 00:04:11.600
Yes. This is... Yamagiwa.

00:04:12.150 --> 00:04:14.710
Yamagiwa. Watanabe...

00:04:14.780 --> 00:04:16.670
How did you do, Yagami?

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:22.150
Yay!

00:04:23.680 --> 00:04:25.300
You're back at the
top of the class!

00:04:25.460 --> 00:04:27.740
Way to go, Yagami!

00:04:45.740 --> 00:04:46.770
Manager!

00:04:47.610 --> 00:04:48.210
Huh?

00:04:50.350 --> 00:04:54.080
Hi, Yagami. Are you
being tutored today?

00:04:54.180 --> 00:04:58.170
No. I just wanted to
show you something.

00:05:02.490 --> 00:05:05.260
My mock exam score improved.

00:05:06.530 --> 00:05:08.400
Why did you come
to show me this?

00:05:08.860 --> 00:05:11.270
Oh? I thought you were
"concerned" about me.

00:05:11.970 --> 00:05:15.330
I understand you even
told my teacher on me.

00:05:15.780 --> 00:05:18.100
Your "concern" wasn't
necessary after all, was it?

00:05:18.410 --> 00:05:19.900
I never--!

00:05:22.720 --> 00:05:25.650
It doesn't matter how you did it.

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:28.150
The bottom line is
you told on me.

00:05:33.600 --> 00:05:37.030
Yagami, you look
pretty worn out.

00:05:38.120 --> 00:05:40.910
You must have pushed
yourself hard to study.

00:05:41.730 --> 00:05:44.640
I sure did
for Mr. Godai's sake.

00:05:45.140 --> 00:05:47.100
Why, you little--!

00:05:49.140 --> 00:05:50.490
I'm ba--!

00:05:51.350 --> 00:05:53.970
Welcome home.
Where are you going?

00:05:54.720 --> 00:05:56.800
I didn't know you were here.

00:05:57.350 --> 00:05:59.140
Her test score improved.

00:05:59.780 --> 00:06:01.010
That's right.

00:06:01.180 --> 00:06:04.950
Now you can resume
being my tuto-

00:06:07.850 --> 00:06:08.610
H-Hey!

00:06:08.850 --> 00:06:10.850
What are you doing, Yagami?!

00:06:27.670 --> 00:06:29.580
I think it's just
lack of sleep.

00:06:29.910 --> 00:06:32.350
Sorry to trouble you.

00:06:32.850 --> 00:06:34.040
It's okay.

00:06:35.260 --> 00:06:39.280
It's amazing what young people
can put themselves through.

00:06:40.700 --> 00:06:42.240
That's just her personality.

00:07:29.010 --> 00:07:30.840
Thank you very much.

00:07:31.710 --> 00:07:33.100
Mr. Godai.

00:07:33.540 --> 00:07:38.470
I'll walk you to the station.
I don't want you to collapse again.

00:07:38.980 --> 00:07:39.870
Really?!

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:43.140
M-May I?

00:07:43.780 --> 00:07:45.280
You have to do
what you have to do.

00:07:45.350 --> 00:07:47.780
You don't have to ask her
for permission!

00:07:47.960 --> 00:07:48.850
Geez!

00:07:53.100 --> 00:07:56.180
Don't bother seeing
us off, Manager.

00:07:56.270 --> 00:07:58.200
Let's go, Mr. Godai.

00:08:01.780 --> 00:08:04.230
Hey! Don't get so close!

00:08:04.450 --> 00:08:07.070
But I don't know when
I might collapse again.

00:08:07.280 --> 00:08:08.330
Liar!

00:08:22.530 --> 00:08:25.680
She's starting up again?

00:08:25.970 --> 00:08:27.260
Who knows.

00:08:27.470 --> 00:08:28.110
Huh?

00:08:31.210 --> 00:08:34.940
No? Shucks.
It woulda been fun.

00:08:43.190 --> 00:08:46.610
I couldn't be so assertive.

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:51.180
Even when I was Yagami's age,
I wasn't like that.

00:08:53.120 --> 00:08:55.020
I guess that's her personality.

00:08:55.720 --> 00:08:56.920
Besides

00:08:56.990 --> 00:09:02.150
I didn't have a single rival
when I was pursuing Soichiro.

00:09:03.710 --> 00:09:04.800
"Rival"?

00:09:08.680 --> 00:09:12.300
Who am I kidding? ! Why would I-

00:09:15.370 --> 00:09:18.340
I forgot to go grocery shopping
for dinner!

00:09:44.400 --> 00:09:47.700
Now that I've gotten over
the major roadblock...

00:09:56.010 --> 00:10:00.040
...all I have to do is to get
that widow out of the picture.

00:10:27.540 --> 00:10:29.220
This will be
self-study time.

00:10:29.310 --> 00:10:32.210
Please ask Mr. Godai
if you have any questions.

00:10:32.370 --> 00:10:33.310
That'll be all.

00:10:33.370 --> 00:10:35.130
Yes, Mr. Yotsuya!

00:10:43.690 --> 00:10:46.870
What's wrong with this situation?

00:10:49.560 --> 00:10:51.920
Mr. Godai, I have a question.

00:10:52.470 --> 00:10:54.590
Please ask Mr. Yotsuya.

00:10:54.710 --> 00:10:56.010
But--

00:10:56.440 --> 00:10:58.880
Let me take this opportunity
to remind you

00:10:59.020 --> 00:11:01.800
that I'm not your tutor anymore!

00:11:02.790 --> 00:11:07.340
I don't want to hear any more
"Mr. Godai" from you.

00:11:07.950 --> 00:11:09.150
I see.

00:11:10.670 --> 00:11:14.120
Then... Yusaku?

00:11:17.330 --> 00:11:19.000
I've brought you some tea.

00:11:19.600 --> 00:11:21.300
D-Did you hear what
she just said?

00:11:22.840 --> 00:11:25.100
Manager, please don't bother.

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:30.520
I've brought my own tea
and cake for us.

00:11:31.050 --> 00:11:34.380
From now on, your refreshments
will be absolutely unnecessary.

00:11:35.990 --> 00:11:37.170
Please.

00:11:37.680 --> 00:11:39.020
Thanks.

00:11:42.060 --> 00:11:42.950
Please!

00:11:48.560 --> 00:11:52.960
So much cake--so little time!

00:11:53.300 --> 00:11:56.060
This is no time for a dumb joke.

00:11:56.970 --> 00:11:58.830
Come in, please.

00:11:59.550 --> 00:12:00.910
Cake? Looks great.

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:08.330
Hey!

00:12:20.830 --> 00:12:21.850
What's wrong?

00:12:21.930 --> 00:12:23.130
Nothing.

00:12:24.100 --> 00:12:27.270
I knew it. You're in love
with Mr. Godai.

00:12:27.510 --> 00:12:29.530
Yagami, stop it.
W-What're you saying?

00:12:29.750 --> 00:12:33.170
It's true. I'm sure of it.

00:12:33.470 --> 00:12:35.740
Otherwise, why would
she try to stop me?

00:12:38.990 --> 00:12:40.340
What do you think?

00:12:40.420 --> 00:12:41.540
I dunno.

00:12:41.620 --> 00:12:45.970
C'mon. They're duking it
out at the same level.

00:12:52.330 --> 00:12:53.300
She walked out.

00:12:55.640 --> 00:12:56.290
Mr. Godai!

00:12:56.370 --> 00:12:57.490
Let 'em go.

00:12:57.560 --> 00:12:59.220
I can't leave
those two alone now!

00:12:59.300 --> 00:13:00.530
Don't worry.

00:13:00.600 --> 00:13:02.220
Nothing's gonna happen.

00:13:02.440 --> 00:13:03.670
Manager.

00:13:11.850 --> 00:13:12.940
Um...

00:13:14.950 --> 00:13:18.120
Please don't listen to them.

00:13:18.530 --> 00:13:21.310
I'm sorry for acting
so immature.

00:13:21.720 --> 00:13:23.780
No... Please...

00:13:24.530 --> 00:13:26.050
I should know better

00:13:26.170 --> 00:13:27.920
than to let a high school
girl get to me.

00:13:28.140 --> 00:13:28.660
Huh?

00:13:32.880 --> 00:13:34.140
Manager.

00:13:38.380 --> 00:13:39.800
Manager...

00:13:51.030 --> 00:13:54.550
So that'll be that.

00:13:54.690 --> 00:13:55.550
Yeah.

00:13:56.460 --> 00:13:59.530
I wish they continued
in spite of us.

00:13:59.770 --> 00:14:02.890
I guess they don't like
to be in the public eye.

00:14:03.600 --> 00:14:04.960
Do you mind--?!

00:14:28.350 --> 00:14:30.620
Looks like it's gonna
be another hot day.

00:14:31.670 --> 00:14:32.920
I'm off!

00:14:33.500 --> 00:14:34.180
Bye.

00:14:34.270 --> 00:14:35.720
Hey, everyone!

00:14:36.200 --> 00:14:40.270
Yotsuya got paid for
tutoring that girl Yagami.

00:14:40.670 --> 00:14:44.100
Let's have a party at
Chachamaru tonight!

00:14:45.050 --> 00:14:46.470
Sounds great!

00:14:46.670 --> 00:14:48.910
Godai, are you free tonight?

00:14:49.050 --> 00:14:51.780
I'll be there for sure!

00:14:52.080 --> 00:14:54.310
He owes me one, anyway.

00:14:56.490 --> 00:14:58.650
I'm not paying.

00:14:59.590 --> 00:15:02.180
You're coming too,
aren't you, Manager?

00:15:03.370 --> 00:15:04.080
Me?

00:15:04.590 --> 00:15:07.050
C'mon! Let's go!
Let's drink together!

00:15:08.910 --> 00:15:10.740
I'M NOT PAYING!

00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:12.800
We'll straighten that out later.

00:15:13.040 --> 00:15:14.550
Let's party!

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:35.080
What's Yagami doing here?

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:42.310
Manager, what's the matter?

00:15:43.240 --> 00:15:45.820
Yagami, you're still in
high school, aren't you?

00:15:46.330 --> 00:15:48.170
Is that a problem?

00:15:48.700 --> 00:15:49.900
I don't think it's appropriate

00:15:49.970 --> 00:15:53.380
for a high school student
to be in a place like this.

00:15:53.670 --> 00:15:56.100
Are you going to
tell on me again?

00:15:56.490 --> 00:15:57.750
Of course not.

00:15:57.810 --> 00:16:00.300
Chachamaru. Godai? Hi.

00:16:03.050 --> 00:16:07.680
I see. I'll give
them the message. Bye.

00:16:09.190 --> 00:16:12.260
Godai said he may not be
able to make it tonight

00:16:12.330 --> 00:16:14.920
because he has to go out with
his preschool co-workers.

00:16:15.930 --> 00:16:17.050
How could he?!

00:16:17.910 --> 00:16:20.460
He'd leave me here
to go out with his co-workers?!

00:16:20.570 --> 00:16:21.130
Hey!

00:16:21.200 --> 00:16:22.760
I need a drink!

00:16:23.200 --> 00:16:24.420
He can't help it.

00:16:24.800 --> 00:16:26.670
Sometimes, you have to go
along with your co-workers.

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:28.870
Master, beer please!

00:16:28.940 --> 00:16:30.500
R-Really?

00:16:30.580 --> 00:16:32.070
Let her drink some soy sauce.

00:16:35.890 --> 00:16:38.010
I know you're disappointed, too.

00:16:38.350 --> 00:16:39.210
Not me.

00:16:40.550 --> 00:16:43.920
You're such a liar!

00:16:44.170 --> 00:16:45.260
What are you talking about?

00:16:45.800 --> 00:16:48.660
If you love him,
why don't you admit it?

00:16:48.870 --> 00:16:50.990
It's so selfish to pretend
you don't love him

00:16:51.060 --> 00:16:52.660
and expect him to love you.

00:16:52.740 --> 00:16:53.630
When did I ever--?

00:16:53.700 --> 00:16:55.170
All the time.

00:16:57.050 --> 00:16:59.740
Or would it somehow
put you in a bad position

00:16:59.810 --> 00:17:01.010
if others should find out?

00:17:01.150 --> 00:17:02.700
Why do you always try
to pick a fight with me?

00:17:02.880 --> 00:17:05.480
I hate people
who aren't upfront.

00:17:06.550 --> 00:17:08.310
You love him, don't you?

00:17:09.650 --> 00:17:11.950
Huh? Answer me!

00:17:13.530 --> 00:17:15.720
Shall I tell you the truth?

00:17:16.970 --> 00:17:19.890
I kissed Mr. Godai.

00:17:27.780 --> 00:17:28.630
No I didn't!

00:17:32.680 --> 00:17:36.270
See? It's obvious you
want him for yourself.

00:17:37.990 --> 00:17:39.180
I'll have another beer!

00:17:47.230 --> 00:17:49.840
I'm not paying.

00:17:50.560 --> 00:17:52.430
Let's just get this straight.

00:17:53.740 --> 00:17:56.060
You're afraid
you'll lose to me.

00:17:58.660 --> 00:17:59.640
Coward!

00:18:00.210 --> 00:18:01.300
Faker!

00:18:01.570 --> 00:18:02.660
Wimp!

00:18:08.810 --> 00:18:10.680
You're not wrong.

00:18:12.880 --> 00:18:14.640
I am afraid.

00:18:15.190 --> 00:18:16.050
You can't be in love

00:18:16.120 --> 00:18:18.110
if you're afraid of getting
your heart broken.

00:18:21.000 --> 00:18:23.290
I'm not afraid of heartbreak.

00:18:24.030 --> 00:18:26.880
I'm afraid that maybe
everything was a lie.

00:18:28.060 --> 00:18:29.190
That's what I'm afraid of...

00:18:29.970 --> 00:18:32.580
What are you babbling about?

00:18:33.630 --> 00:18:35.090
You're drunk, aren't you?

00:18:35.600 --> 00:18:36.770
I sure am.

00:18:39.310 --> 00:18:42.550
I just can't get into
the mood tonight.

00:18:42.610 --> 00:18:43.900
Shall we call it a night?

00:18:44.110 --> 00:18:46.980
Yes! I agree, I say!

00:18:47.050 --> 00:18:50.070
I haven't had enough to drink,
but all right, I guess.

00:18:50.320 --> 00:18:52.290
Let's wrap it up!

00:18:53.960 --> 00:18:55.010
Sorry to be so late!

00:18:56.800 --> 00:18:58.810
Yay! Mr. Godai!!

00:18:59.360 --> 00:19:01.300
I've been waiting for you!

00:19:01.470 --> 00:19:03.080
What're you doing here, Yagami?

00:19:09.400 --> 00:19:13.830
Manager, I'm going to take
Yagami to the station.

00:19:14.910 --> 00:19:16.340
Good night!

00:19:17.250 --> 00:19:17.970
H-Hey!

00:19:18.340 --> 00:19:20.280
Bye-bye!

00:19:22.080 --> 00:19:24.600
So who ended up paying?

00:19:24.690 --> 00:19:25.900
I dunno.

00:19:26.000 --> 00:19:28.190
I'm not paying.

00:19:29.730 --> 00:19:30.950
Oh well.

00:19:33.360 --> 00:19:36.620
It's simple for you, Yagami.

00:19:38.440 --> 00:19:43.240
He's your first love, isn't he?

00:19:55.490 --> 00:19:57.680
Ms. Kamiyogi, here
are the worksheets.

00:19:57.880 --> 00:19:59.400
Thank you.

00:20:00.430 --> 00:20:06.410
Yagami, is Mr. Godai
still tutoring you?

00:20:06.940 --> 00:20:09.830
Well, yes. It's not
a problem, is it?

00:20:09.900 --> 00:20:12.390
It's not affecting my grades.

00:20:16.070 --> 00:20:22.450
It's fine, but I hope you're not
troubling Ms. Otonashi.

00:20:23.450 --> 00:20:25.740
Probably, because that wido--

00:20:26.550 --> 00:20:29.990
that manager's in
love with Mr. Godai.

00:20:30.290 --> 00:20:32.640
Is that right? I had no idea.

00:20:32.960 --> 00:20:34.910
It's obvious, if you
watch her behavior.

00:20:39.090 --> 00:20:40.690
She tries so hard to hide it.

00:20:40.940 --> 00:20:42.620
She's so wishy-washy.

00:20:42.970 --> 00:20:47.390
If what you're saying is true,
it's very much like her.

00:20:49.400 --> 00:20:53.030
She's too serious
and rather inflexible.

00:20:54.450 --> 00:20:58.280
She was very much
in love with her husband.

00:20:59.910 --> 00:21:04.070
There are many truths
in this world

00:21:04.150 --> 00:21:08.750
but she's the type to believe
that there is only one truth.

00:21:09.270 --> 00:21:12.000
So if she falls in
love with another man

00:21:12.060 --> 00:21:16.050
she'd think that her love for her
husband was not true.

00:21:16.360 --> 00:21:18.410
That would be her conclusion.

00:21:21.370 --> 00:21:24.000
I hate that kind of thinking.

00:21:25.910 --> 00:21:27.750
It just means
she doesn't have guts.

00:21:32.250 --> 00:21:34.980
You wouldn't understand.

00:21:37.690 --> 00:21:39.400
Well, I'll see you later.

00:21:39.550 --> 00:21:42.310
Don't give Ms. Otonashi
too much trouble.

00:21:42.660 --> 00:21:43.720
Bye.

00:22:00.220 --> 00:22:05.680
So she loves Mr. Godai as
much as her husband...?

00:22:06.790 --> 00:22:09.370
I'm afraid that maybe
everything was a lie.

00:22:09.850 --> 00:22:12.760
Maybe I said too much
to her the other day.

00:22:13.730 --> 00:22:15.840
I hope she's not dwelling
on what I said.

00:22:18.120 --> 00:22:19.840
I better cheer her up.

00:23:07.220 --> 00:23:08.330
Coward!

00:23:15.990 --> 00:23:17.600
Coward!

00:23:45.740 --> 00:23:48.060
What? ! You're
Mr. Godai's grandma?!

00:23:48.140 --> 00:23:50.000
She's here because she's
worried about his job hunt.

00:23:50.070 --> 00:23:52.240
Nice to meet you!
I'm his girlfriend, Yagami.

00:23:52.300 --> 00:23:54.240
H-How dare you
say that, Yagami!

00:23:54.310 --> 00:23:56.570
This is getting more
and more interesting!

00:23:56.650 --> 00:24:00.040
Next time: "Even Yagami is Shocked!
The Return of Gold-Toothed Grandma!"

00:24:00.110 --> 00:24:02.800
Let's have a wild party!
